Scenario_Analysis

SEU Plans to develop a Student Activities Management System (SAMS) to centralize extracurricular activity management.
The system should allow students to browse activities, register, cancel registrations before deadlines, receive notifications, record attendance electronically, and access their activity history.
Activity organizers should be able to create, edit, publish, and manage activities, registrations, attendance, certificates, and reports.
Student Affairs should approve activities, manage categories, monitor participation statistics, verify transcripts, and generate institutional reports.
The system should also support waiting lists, notifications, and automatic activity transcript generation.
